@startuml
actor Client
participant "Fleet API" as API
database Redis
database PostgreSQL

Client -> API : GET stato corrente
API -> Redis : lettura cache
Redis --> API : unavailable o miss
API -> PostgreSQL : query latest sample
PostgreSQL --> API : latest sample
API -> Redis : read repair best effort (prima della risposta)
Redis --> API : successo o errore/timeout gestito
API --> Client : stato con freshness
@enduml
